==Battleground==
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
